@FridgeApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### List all items (soonest expiry first)
GET {{FridgeApi_HostAddress}}/api/items
Accept: application/json

### Add an item
POST {{FridgeApi_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk",
  "quantity": 1,
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-22"
}

### Delete an item
DELETE {{FridgeApi_HostAddress}}/api/items/1
